# OpenCap Lite — Build Prompts for Claude Code / Replit Agents

**Source spec:** `OpenCapLite_PRD.md`  
**Stack:** Next.js 14 (App Router) + TypeScript + React + Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Prisma + PostgreSQL + Zod + React Hook Form + TanStack Table + Vitest + fast-check + Playwright + Docker  
**Total Prompts:** 36 (across 6 layers + final)  
**Build order:** Foundation → Backend → Frontend Shell → Integration → Polish → Verification

-----

## How to use this document

Paste one prompt at a time into your coding agent (Claude Code, Replit Agent, Cursor, etc.). **Do not skip ahead.** Run each VERIFICATION PROMPT before starting the next layer. If an agent fails a verification, re-run the failing prompt before proceeding.

Every prompt assumes the agent has access to `OpenCapLite_PRD.md` in the project root. If not, paste the relevant PRD section into the agent’s context first.

